# Files Cursor AI (Agent, Tab, @-mentions) must not read.
# https://cursor.com/docs/context/ignore-files
# Cursor already ignores everything in .gitignore plus its defaults (.env*, lockfiles,
# node_modules/, .venv/, caches, binaries). This file only adds and overrides.
# Not a security boundary: Agent's terminal and MCP tools can still read these files.

# ---------- secrets (defense in depth, also in .gitignore) ----------
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.crt
**/secrets*.yaml
**/secrets*.json
!**/secrets.example.yaml

# ---------- overrides: templates the AI should see ----------
# `.env*` from the defaults would hide the settings template we keep in sync with Settings.
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
